***Trusic*** a True Music choice of you. 
***You*** press play - Trusic looks inwards, recent hums, recent triggers, similar past moments - plays closest emotional association. 

AI use case: play the song that best matches the user's feeling and Not what music people like in general  
Existing: User opens the app. searches and plays a song(baseline)

**pros:** ***less skipping, More "yeah this is good", music feels found not chosen***

